<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Zomato Page</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
      color: #222;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #e23744;
      font-size: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #1a3b5c;
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    h3 {
      color: #2c5f8a;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    h4 {
      color: #3b7bb5;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    p {
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    hr {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
      margin: 22px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Main heading and intro for the page -->
  <h1>Welcome to My Zomato Page</h1>
  <p>Zomato makes ordering food ridiculously easy — I can browse restaurants nearby, check ratings, and get food delivered in under 30 minutes.</p>

  <hr>

  <!-- Section 1: features of the app -->
  <h2>Features</h2>
  <p>Live order tracking, restaurant reviews, and quick reordering from past orders.</p>

  <hr>

  <!-- Section 2: personal reason for using it -->
  <h3>Why I Use It</h3>
  <p>I use Zomato almost every weekend because the offers and Gold discounts are genuinely useful.</p>

  <hr>

  <!-- Section 3: a memorable moment -->
  <h4>My Favorite Moment</h4>
  <p>Once I ordered biryani at 1 AM during exams and it arrived in 22 minutes — that's when I became a fan.</p>

</body>
</html>
